CONTROL

Chu Chu rocket can be played with mouse, 
keyboard, joysticks or jaguar pads.

{2}PLACING ARROWS: {1}
Move cursor over desired square.
Hold down fire - cursor will now change into small arrow sprite.
Whilst still holding down fire, move in a 
the direction you want the arrow to point. 
Release fire to place arrow.

{2}KEYS: {1}
When playing on keyboard, use cursor keys and space to control the pointer.

